SUMMARY:Let’s Play Board Games!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nWe will be 
 meeting at Fort Nonsense Brewery in Randolph\, NJ! This establishment sell
 s an assortment of small snack items and alcoholic beverages\, but persona
 l food and drink can be brought to the venue. If anyone joining this event
  would like to place an order\, let us know\, we can pitch in.\n\nI'll hav
 e a healthy variety of light to mid weight board/card games that support u
 pwards of 8 to 10 players. Games like Dominion\, Red Dragon Inn\, Love Let
 ter and Flip7\, but also more involved fare like Knarr\, Vale of Eternity\
 , Emberheart\, and Citadels.\n\nFor those interested in chess: I'm cross p
 romoting this with another group event that's happening at the same time a
 nd place\, so feel free to jump in with them. Check out "North NJ Tourname
 nt Chess Masters in Training."\n\nSee you there!\n\nNOTE: If you are not a
 ttending the event\, please change your RSVP accordingly!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316680831/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260923T164943Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923T164943Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
